  "card": "Removes the noexcept specifier from LogOversizedDbCache and adds a test for invalid dbcache values in settings.json. Setting a non-integer value such as 4096.5 causes GetIntArg to throw an exception that hits the noexcept boundary and aborts the node via std::terminate during startup. Removing noexcept allows the exception to propagate to the AppInit handler, letting the node exit cleanly with status 1 and a descriptive error message.",
